      "writtenOn": "2024-10-24T12:46:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "OWNERS approval !\u003d Code-Review+2 permission.\n\nOwners are configured in OWNERS files and, if active, a submit requirement. As @gprocida@google.com mentioned, they will also be taken into consideration when suggesting reviewers.\n\nCode-Review+2 is a permission that is to be configured in the project hierarchy.\nhttps://android-review.git.corp.google.com/admin/repos/kernel/common,access reveals that CR+2 is granted to desktop folks on refs matching `^refs/heads/android.*-desktop`.",
